3D assets and data
------------------
- Meshes, Gaussian splats, and scene assets under assets/ were generated with
  the Aholo Lux3D / Aholo World APIs, procedurally generated by scripts in this
  repository, or produced by the repository's own simulation. See each asset's
  manifest.json / source.json for provenance (generation id, prompt, hashes).
  The terms of service of the generating platform apply to generated content.
- Datasets under datasets/ are simulation captures rendered from these assets
  and from the repository's own scene generator.
- The robot arm geometry in assets/robot/ is AI-generated from an original
  prompt. assets/robots/so_arm100/ contains procedurally built trimesh
  primitives and a self-generated URDF; no third-party CAD files are copied.